  "description": "*\"I really need a helping hand, and you have nowhere to go. A match made in heaven!\"\n\n\"I provide free meals and accommodation.\"*\n\nA man who seems poetic and refined on the surface but harbors a dark side, and a former gangster determined to turn over a new leaf and live a calmer, more meaningful life, cross paths. Love makes you want to keep a journal. Love inspires poetry. Love compels you to write. Love turns words into something beautiful.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
